==Description==
'''Narrator''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]]. It was obtained at Level 9 in the premium track, which costed {{CandyCorns|240 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|48}} ({{Robux|36}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock. It had a total cost of {{CandyCorns|1,150 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|460}} ({{Robux|353}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases the [[Narrator (Narrator)|Narrator]] from the [[Lunar Overture Event]] with its hand on its top hat. It plays the default sound when used.

==Trivia==
*The sound that plays when using the '''Narrator''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.

